  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5e303b6657625d1439b6855e28d0ebd7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PlainMonologue
  monologueText:
  - Every red string on this thing leads back to her. That fucking whore.. God, i
    wish her to become crippled.
  - "This started as\u2026 therapy, I guess. Writing things down, pinning them up,
    pretending I could \u2018solve\u2019 what happened like it\u2019s a puzzle."
  - "Sometimes I stare at this board and wonder if I\u2019m missing something huge. "
  - "Bandwagon fallacy, appeal to majority\u2026 she bought their lie because it
    was easier."
