--- !u!114 &1576250342
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1576250338}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5e303b6657625d1439b6855e28d0ebd7, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PlainMonologue
  monologueText:
  - "I was supposed to learn this thing for her. The amp blew out, and I guess my
    courage did too. Haven\u2019t touched it since."
  - "Every time I look at it, I remember that phase where I thought I\u2019d start
    a band. Turns out dreaming was a lot easier than practicing."
  - It just sits there.
