  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PlainMonologue
  monologueText:
  - I remember the smile she had when she handed me that little plant.
  - "A shoe box collecting dust instead of memories, and polka-dot underwear I swear
    I\u2019m not emotionally attached to\u2026"
  - "That dumb polka-dot underwear\u2026 Mom bought it as a joke."
